{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p15871-ea8bf18e8dfea93a12b7","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","text":"석판을 다 모은 것 같아요","speaker":"","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 6","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["12876513714978606909"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-1989e0c18e5e0976f6e6","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","text":"어디 보자… 정말 다 모으셨네요, 귀빈님. 이게 그 예언가가 남긴 원고인데, 금실로 더 많은 정보를 추출할 수 있을 거예요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6385845973970515612"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-f85f7b8d4b28297a7d0c","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","text":"이제 당신에게 아글라이아 님의 계획을 전부 털어놓을 때가 된 것 같군요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18357266295758918322"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-c9ba6a590b462400564a","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","text":"그 계획은 검은 물결에 저항한다는 작지만 숭고한 이상에서 시작되었습니다. 정확히는 검은 물결 속에서 살아남는 것이죠","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10024652598623589353"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-235c0579e5365d10d118","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","text":"검은 물결이 앰포리어스를 파괴했다는 건 귀빈님도 아실 거예요. 인간이든 환수든 그 영향에서 살아남을 수 있는 존재는 없어요. 딱 하나만 제외하고요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11186262957139615"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-9a9ac4b8a5f261846b87","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","text":"약충… 말인가요?","speaker":"","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 6","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2169983583937221340"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-6bb55a6b79288423402b","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","text":"네. 귀빈님도 보셨겠지만 방직공은 잠시나마 검은 물결의 습격을 막아낼 수 있습니다. 자유롭게 움직일 수 있는 건 아니지만, 검은 물결도 그들을 완전히 집어삼키진 못하더군요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4724654330951579038"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-b4393fb3b7acac38ecad","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","text":"이게 무에서 유로 향하는 첫걸음입니다. 방직공의 비밀에 숨겨진 원리를 밝혀낸다면, 언젠간 앰포리어스인도 천재지변을 두려워하지 않게 되겠죠","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["122107287254689206"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-05f7c024b7e61eefcb40","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","text":"하지만 계산해 보니 계획을 위해서는 우리가 찾을 수 있는 것보다 더 많은 약충이 필요합니다. 남은 약충을 어디서 찾아야 할진 저도 감이 안 잡히네요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8164444647249959667"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-cf3e4cfe975fdbd1b323","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","text":"어쨌든 지금까지 도와주셔서 감사했습니다","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6497446629892875505"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p15871","title":"「의상공」","page":"「衣匠」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p15871-ea8bf18e8dfea93a12b7","rowId":"other-npc-p15871-ea8bf18e8dfea93a12b7","missionId":"npc-p15871","mission":"「의상공」","sceneId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","scene":"NPC 대사 6","contextId":"wiki-context-fcac610fd20d02733398bf7b","page":"「衣匠」","revision":99848,"location":[0,0,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["d9aab842afde-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15871-1989e0c18e5e0976f6e6"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-1989e0c18e5e0976f6e6","rowId":"other-npc-p15871-1989e0c18e5e0976f6e6","missionId":"npc-p15871","mission":"「의상공」","sceneId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","scene":"NPC 대사 6","contextId":"wiki-context-fcac610fd20d02733398bf7b","page":"「衣匠」","revision":99848,"location":[0,0,"reply",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["d9aab842afde-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15871-f85f7b8d4b28297a7d0c"],"replyToIds":["other-npc-p15871-ea8bf18e8dfea93a12b7"],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-f85f7b8d4b28297a7d0c","rowId":"other-npc-p15871-f85f7b8d4b28297a7d0c","missionId":"npc-p15871","mission":"「의상공」","sceneId":"sc2b076c1dba9879c","scene":"NPC 대사 6","contextId":"wiki-context-fcac610fd20d02733398bf7b","page":"「衣匠」","revision":99848,"location":[0,0,"reply",0,1],"conditions":[],"branch":["d9aab842afde-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15871-c9ba6a590b462400564a"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-c9ba6a590b462400564a","rowI